      "qp_ledoit_wolf_lambda": 0.2,
      "_qp_ledoit_wolf_lambda_reason": "2026-05-10 C3: bumped 0.0\u21920.2 (Ledoit-Wolf 2004 mid-of-recommended-range). 169-stock universe sample-cov is high-noise / near-singular without shrinkage; \u03bb=0.2 lifts off-diagonals toward 0 and equalises variance toward avg. Reference: Ledoit & Wolf 2004 Honey paper (J.PortMgmt 30(4):110-119).",
      "qp_sector_cap_enabled": true,
      "_qp_sector_cap_enabled_reason": "2026-05-10 C2: hard linear sector cap inside QP solve. Total sector weight \u2264 max_positions_per_sector \u00d7 max_position_pct. Closes audit gap where stress reallocation could exceed sector cap that buy-side filter enforced.",
